          <h1 id="cookie-title">Cookie Policy — How We Use Cookies & Similar Technologies</h1>
          <p class="lead">JOOD uses cookies, pixels and similar technologies to provide essential site functions, analyze performance, and deliver personalized content and advertising (with consent where required). This policy explains what we use, why, and how you can control it.</p>
          <p class="note"><strong>Effective date:</strong> 1 January 2026. This policy applies to JOOD FZ-LLC and its affiliates.</p>
        </div>

